{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kR8JoVWwvV1792676884.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球網站廣泛使用的程式語言「PHP」，被發現有嚴重保安漏洞，黑客有機會控制網站，造成敏感信息洩露。</p><p></p><p>數字辦稱，高度關注事件，已向所有政府部門以及公營機構發保安警報，要求即時檢視系統有否受影響，盡快完成修補，否則系統須暫時離線或隔離。目前為止，當局無接獲任何相關網絡保安事故報告。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:30.157690+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.268352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:22.925353+00:00","content_hash":"286984534595bcb74b955431701f428fbf92c1c996e0c86dd69548a63ad001da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:30.157690+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}